      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1961, a $3.27 million donation from Grace Watson let RIT buy a 1,300\u2011acre campus south of Rochester along the Genesee River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
