      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The campus\u2019s Field House, opened in 2004, was named after Lucius \u201cBob\u201d Gordon and his wife Marie and hosts concerts, graduations, and sports.",
